        "text": "**ROOT OUT HERESY**\n\nRanged weapons equipped by **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITOR**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** and **ORDO HERETICUS** models from your army have the **[IGNORES COVER]** ability.\n\nEach time an **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITOR**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS** model from your army makes an attack that targets a Chaos unit containing 5 or more models, that attack has the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability.",
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Take And Hold"
          ]
        }
      },
