          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of any phase (excluding the Command phase).\n\n**TARGET:** One **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS GRENADES** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit (excluding **MONSTERS** or **VEHICLES**) within 8\" of and visible to your unit. That enemy unit must take a Battle‐shock test and, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Truesilver Armour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Malleus, Daemon Hunters"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GREY KNIGHTS TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Violent Acquisition": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Imperialis Fleet"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit within range of an objective marker, that attack has the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**, **[LANCE]** and **[IGNORES COVER]** abilities."
      },
      "Stratagem§Will-Sapping Salvo": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Veiled Blade Elimination Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM INFANTRY** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability. In addition, if it is a **CULEXUS ASSASSIN** unit, until the end of the phase, change the Damage characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit to 3."
      },
